{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790670780, "covers_from": "2026-09-29T08:33:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-09-29T08:34:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790670840, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-09-29T08:33:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 35954, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "這幾年的台北市街頭真的越來越髒亂，每天都看到滿地的垃圾，能不能多設置垃圾桶並且多派人手清理！", "display_name": "松山代表 Eliza 依萊莎", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-29T08:33:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 24879, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "交通", "content": "為何老是有舉辦路跑 台北市舉辦路跑已經造成上班駕駛人必須改道遲到怎麼辦而且浪費資源義交警察\n請了解", "display_name": "中正代表 jason 荔枝", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-29T08:33:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 1158, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "開車突然到路口變成左轉道 很困擾", "display_name": "大安代表 No.1,158", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-29T08:33:36+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 9132, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "環境", "content": "垃圾制度可以比照東京有固定收集點.", "display_name": "士林代表 No.9,132", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-29T08:33:42+00:00", "duration_seconds": 18, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 41287, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "文化", "content": "不要把台北變成第二個東京或首爾。應把高功能高科技安全便利做更好並保留那種有點亂、生活化的小尺度城市感", "display_name": "大安代表 No.41,287", "mood": "hopeful", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 24879, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "display_name": "中正代表 jason 荔枝", "district": "zhongzheng", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 1158, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.1,158", "district": "daan", "is_rep